              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "El suceso ocurrió el lunes. The incident took place on Monday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In a newspaper, la sección de sucesos is the page of accidents and crimes. It is a false friend: success is el éxito."
            }
