          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tener lugar is built on tener, inherited from Latin tenēre 'to hold' (EtymDB), and lugar, which is usually traced to Latin locālis 'of a place', from locus 'a place' (Lewis & Short). To take place is, word for word, to hold a place."
